+# Fleet local guide
+
+This content-only package uses ZCode's existing `zcode-guide@zcode-plugins-official`
+identity and plugin lifecycle for compatibility. It adds no executable server or permission path.
+The UI imports `docs/guide.en.md` and `docs/guide.zh-CN.md` directly; the configuration skill reads
