+
+The guide describes the Fleet candidate. It does not imply that unimplemented UI plugins, workflow
+commands or integrations exist. Original ZCode plugin infrastructure is Apache-2.0-licensed; its original
+notices remain in the repository LICENSE. Fleet guide content is maintained alongside the code.
